@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Delete task, toast expiry
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "User" as user
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (UI components)" #E0F2FE
  participant "ToastComponent" as toast
end box
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "TodoStore" as store
end box
note over store : Task already removed and toast "Task deleted" shown with Undo (L2-015)
store -> store : 6 s timer elapses without Undo (L2-015)
store -> store : Clear the toast signal
store --> toast : Toast dismissed
toast --> user : Toast gone, the deletion stands (L2-015)
@enduml
